# Migration 001: Project Separation

ID: 001-project-separation
Status: APPLIED
AppliedAt: 2026-08-29T08:00:00Z

Description:
  Separate project model (.sdd/project/) from project instances
  (.sdd/projects/<name>/). Concrete project state moves out of
  .sdd/project/ into .sdd/projects/vkard.az/.

Before:
  .sdd/project/
    decisions/
    tasks/
    docs/
    stack/
    context/
    cases/
    bugs/
    dependencies/
    gates/
    observability/
    workflow/
    architecture/
    testing/
    tokens/

After:
  .sdd/project/                    ← Model schemas only
    project.sdd
    domains.sdd
    modules.sdd
    map.sdd
    flows.sdd
    dependencies.sdd
    indexes.sdd
    instantiation.sdd
    mode.sdd
    architecture.sdd
    README.sdd
    INDEX.sdd

  .sdd/projects/vkard.az/          ← Concrete project instance
    decisions/
    tasks/
    docs/
    stack/
    context/
    cases/
    bugs/
    dependencies/
    gates/
    observability/
    workflow/
    architecture/
    testing/
    tokens/

Actions:
  1. Create .sdd/projects/vkard.az/ directory
  2. Move .sdd/project/*/ subdirectories to .sdd/projects/vkard.az/
  3. Update .sdd/project/INDEX.sdd to model-only registry
  4. Update .sdd/projects/INDEX.sdd to include vkard.az
  5. Update all path references from .sdd/project/<subdir>/ to
     .sdd/projects/vkard.az/<subdir>/
  6. Update root docs (README.md, CLAUDE.md, TEST_GUIDE.md)

Validation:
  - .sdd/project/ contains no concrete project state directories
  - .sdd/projects/vkard.az/ contains all concrete project state
  - All .sdd/ references resolve correctly
  - Root docs reference vkard.az

Rollback: NOT SUPPORTED (git history preserves original state)

State: +
